<title>USA: Sedro-Woolley, Wash. yields 5.60 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Sedro-Woolley, Wash. yields 5.60 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it priced $2.355 million of Sedro-Woolley, Wash., general obligation bonds, 1996, with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2016.</p>
